        <mxCell id="Y5kbWOOBGGrftG058avu-14" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=21;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#9A3412;" value="Backend Python / FastAPI&#xa;Render" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="65" width="260" x="1245" y="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Y5kbWOOBGGrftG058avu-15" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fillColor=#FFEDD5;strokeColor=#FB923C;fontSize=13;" value="Autoridade da partida&#xa;&#xa;• Processa movimentos&#xa;• Calcula física e colisões&#xa;• Mantém placar e estado canônico&#xa;• Publica estado a ~30 FPS&#xa;• REST API + Swagger + WebSocket&#xa;• Wildcard global: pong/+/+/movimento&#xa;• LWT: status/backend = offline" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="270" x="1240" y="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Y5kbWOOBGGrftG058avu-16" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FDF2F8;strokeColor=#DB2777;strokeWidth=2;arcSize=8;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="350" width="330" x="1210" y="510" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Y5kbWOOBGGrftG058avu-17" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=21;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#9D174D;" value="Frontend React&#xa;Vercel" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="65" width="260" x="1245" y="530" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Y5kbWOOBGGrftG058avu-18" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fillColor=#FCE7F3;strokeColor=#EC4899;fontSize=13;" value="Interface web em tempo real&#xa;&#xa;• Renderiza o Pong&#xa;• Exibe placar e status ESP32&#xa;• Logs MQTT e chat&#xa;• Chart.js: posições e mensagens&#xa;• Publica READY / RESET / chat&#xa;• Wildcard restrito: pong/sala1/+/movimento&#xa;• WSS seguro na porta 8884" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="215" width="270" x="1240" y="610" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Y5kbWOOBGGrftG058avu-19" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fillColor=#F3F4F6;strokeColor=#6B7280;fontSize=14;" value="FLUXO PRINCIPAL&#xa;1. Potenciômetro → ESP32 publica movimento (QoS 0)&#xa;2. HiveMQ entrega movimento ao Backend e Frontend&#xa;3. Backend calcula bola, colisão e placar&#xa;4. Backend publica estado (QoS 0), placar (QoS 1) e evento crítico (QoS 2)&#xa;5. Frontend atualiza jogo, gráficos, logs e status&#xa;6. Botão/Frontend publica comando READY → Backend inicia partida" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="210" width="690" x="410" y="690" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
